@startuml
' AmbuDock — Deployment / Network Architecture (clean & bilingual)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam wrapWidth 220
hide stereotype
title AmbuDock — Deployment / Network Architecture (AWS)\n배포/네트워크 아키텍처

' -------- ROW #1 : Internet & External --------
together {
  cloud "Internet (인터넷)" as NET {
    [User Browser\nReact SPA] as BROWSER
  }

  cloud "External APIs (외부 API)" as EXT {
    [NMC ER/ICU API] as NMC
    [MOIS Alerts]   as MOIS
    [Kakao Local / ReverseGeo] as KAKAO
    [TMAP Routing REST] as TMAP
  }
}

' -------- ROW #2 : AWS VPC --------
together {
  node "AWS VPC" as VPC {
    node "Public Subnet" as PUB {
      [ALB\nHTTPS 443, ACM TLS] as ALB
    }
    node "Private Subnet" as PRI {
      node "EC2 (App)" as EC2 {
        [Nginx (Reverse Proxy)\n:80 -> :8080] as NGINX
        [Spring Boot :8080\nMaven, WebClient, JPA] as SPRING
        [Static Assets\nSPA build] as STATIC
      }
      database "RDS MySQL\n(운영 DB)" as RDS
      [S3 Bucket\nassets / logs] as S3
    }
  }
}

' -------- ROW #3 : CI/CD --------
rectangle "GitHub Actions\n(CI/CD)" as GHA

' ================= FLOWS (short numeric labels) =================
' ingress (요청 유입)
BROWSER --> ALB    : F1
ALB     --> NGINX  : F2
NGINX   --> SPRING : F3

' data plane (데이터 경로)
SPRING  --> RDS : F4
SPRING  --> S3  : F5

' egress (NAT/IGW abstracted)
SPRING  --> NMC  : F6
SPRING  --> MOIS : F7
SPRING  --> KAKAO: F8
SPRING  --> TMAP : F9

' CI/CD
GHA --> SPRING : F10
GHA --> STATIC : F11
STATIC --> NGINX : F12

' -------------------- LEGEND --------------------
legend right
**Flow Legend (흐름 설명)**

F1  Browser -> ALB : HTTPS 443 (TLS/ACM) / 브라우저에서 ALB로
F2  ALB -> Nginx   : HTTP 80 (Target Group) / ALB에서 Nginx로
F3  Nginx -> Spring : reverse proxy (/api -> :8080), SPA static serve

F4  Spring <-> RDS  : JDBC (HikariCP), JPA (Hibernate) / DB 연동
F5  Spring -> S3    : SDK 업로드 (자산/로그)

F6  Spring -> NMC   : WebClient poll 60s / 상태 수집
F7  Spring -> MOIS  : WebClient poll 180s / 재난 수집
F8  Spring -> Kakao : 지오코딩/정합 (온보딩)
F9  Spring -> TMAP  : Proxy /api/tmap/route (경로/ETA 위임)

F10 GitHub Actions -> Spring : JAR 배포 (ssh/scp, systemd restart)
F11 GitHub Actions -> Static : SPA 빌드 업로드
F12 Static -> Nginx : /var/www 배치 (헬스체크 후 교체)
endlegend

' -------------------- NOTES --------------------
note right of NGINX
Nginx
- Serve SPA static files
- Proxy /api/* -> :8080
- gzip, HTTP/2, cache headers
(Nginx: 정적 서빙, API 프록시)
end note

note right of SPRING
Spring Boot
- @Scheduled: NMC 60s, MOIS 180s
- TMAP Proxy: cache 2m, timeout 1.5s
- AppConfig: 운영 파라미터 주입
(Spring 잡/프록시/설정)
end note

note right of RDS
RDS MySQL
- Multi-AZ 권장, Performance Insights
- Basic indexes:
  hospital(lat,lon)
  hli_snapshot(hpid)
  disaster_alert(is_active,severity)
(DB 가용성/인덱스)
end note
@enduml
